abstract: >-
  Interface and backend for the corrective response to contingencies (redispatch and minimum load shedding), N-1 screening,
  repair with block-by-block load reconnection and GENCO validation on the IEEE 14, 30, 57 and 118 systems.
keywords:
  - GENCO
  - power systems
  - contingency analysis
  - OpenGridFM
